{
 "schemaVersion": "rcap-unclassified-blanks-blind-spot/v1",
 "producedBy": "Captain, confirming and generalising a FABLE-VA6 finding",
 "producedOn": "2026-09-02T10:20:36.552Z",
 "atCommit": "46ac0914c760f93cb9a2429d470caa7e433b2092",
 "theFinding": "A counter that cannot see a blank reports zero, and zero reads as proof there is none.",
 "whatVA6Measured": "On three families it held — the MS 99-15-59 dismissal branch, id_felony_reduction-set and rcap-ok-custom-pleading — 2, 1 and 16 blanks where a court must be named exist in no field map, no blanks report and no instruction table. unclassifiedBlanks reports 0 on all three and cannot see them. VA6 re-ran verify-packet-completeness.mjs itself and it passed all three.",
 "theShape": {
  "first": "The caption rule writes \"IN THE ...... COURT\" as a hard-coded literal dot run, while every registered blank goes through the {{DOTS}} placeholder.",
  "second": "The blank ledger is built only from field-map refusals — the build script pushes a row for each entry of canonicalRefusals and for nothing else — so a blank that never entered a field map cannot enter the ledger.",
  "together": "A caption blank is invisible to the counter by construction, not by accident."
 },
 "captainsGeneralisation": {
  "buildScriptsExamined": 191,
  "withARefusalsOnlyBlankLedger": 84,
  "withBothHalvesOfTheShape": 40,
  "ofThoseReportingUnclassifiedBlanksZero": 40
 },
 "whatThisMeans": "unclassifiedBlanks is not evidence of absence on these families. It remains evidence where it is NON-zero, and it remains a true measurement of the blanks that DID enter a field map everywhere. Nothing here says these packets are defective; it says one counter cannot answer for them.",
 "whatWasNotDone": "The instrument was not changed. Making the counter report NOT_MEASURED_ON_THIS_FAMILY instead of 0 is the principled fix, and it touches a shared measurement every family and several gates read — with verification lanes in flight measuring against it, changing it mid-run would invalidate their work. It is left as scoped, named work rather than done carelessly.",
 "doNotConclude": [
  "That any listed family has an uncollected blank. Only opening its artefacts establishes that, and this opened none.",
  "That the other counters are affected. This is about unclassifiedBlanks and the blank ledger that feeds it."
 ],
